OL,11,G0350 Witness History
OL,12,     FIn 1985, a small rural town
OL,13,     Fwelcomed a group of Catholic
OL,14,     Fmissionaries, unaware one would
OL,15,     Fone day be Pope. Among the altar
OL,16,     Fboys was a teenager who would go
OL,17,     Fon to be his friend.
